                      DayDream BBS, DownloadLog.DAT
                      -----------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
0000    UWORD      02    SLOT NUMBER OF THE DOWNLOADER
0002    STRING     31    NAME OF THE FILE
0034    ULONG      04    FILE SIZE
0038    ULONG      04    TIME (SECS SINCE 1978)
0042    UWORD      02    BPS RATE
0044    UBYTE      01    NODE NUMBER
0045    UBYTE      01    CONF NUMBER   
0046    ULONG      04    FREE BLOCK
==============================================================================
0050

